621a3ae\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-075942ad-0b75-47db-888c-5487e66628dd\">​​자세한 설명은 아래를 확인해 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-78ed1de0-350d-4ac9-83fd-07717b587bdb\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-dc279f34-5f4e-4b94-88b8-88668fbf4d90\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-29d3ed33-0bbd-4c9e-b766-e13e4c9c2c40\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-6859fa8e-9842-47f8-acf7-3fa2a9aa8801\">​·····················································································</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5e670620-25cf-4e52-802e-66b2dbf8c03c\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-2c80cf99-df09-452b-a474-1d3ff0e51884\"><b>📢 10월 31일(목) 무점검 업데이트 안내</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-aaa01bff-21b1-4d1f-9d42-2db846bd7944\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-86e687bf-cb0a-453f-a9cf-7cf7c7932399\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-73b54d52-9338-4a62-9c2b-859583dd26f5\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-4d32bf9c-70eb-4deb-b77e-7124a327cd7f\"><b>​✔️ 일시</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-78f6ad1f-e219-4144-9b33-ee5fcbf7d67a\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-c96eb270-1610-4629-9082-70474de24ce6\">- 10월 31일(목) 21:00 ~ 23:00 경</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-240de6e8-3d35-41f8-9d55-1c4cdeebcf7e\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-89ce4bfe-832d-4d9e-a5e1-3dd395f9c9ca\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-54d558e0-0525-41de-8096-91277f67cf6a\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-55943e6a-8a87-4e45-a887-608118ee5db6\"><b>​✔️ 내용</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b1b70f5a-0844-4e1c-bd40-a972861acf91\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-9f2d291f-57fc-4995-bf89-d0da06bc92e5\">- 특정 상황에서 신데렐라의 기본 공격이 움직이는 랩쳐를 명중하기 어려운 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-68b0911b-4766-4ccc-8fce-d4cc31eaedbf\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-36e2433e-440d-454a-9727-150f19dd24e4\">- 캠페인 필드, 로스트 섹터의 일부 포탈이 정상적으로 작동하지 않는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-bf4d479c-bc70-42bc-a8e2-232339abf23f\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-66f152fe-401d-43dd-be77-de715d251064\">└ 해당 현상이 발생할 경우 화면 우측 상단의 [SUB MENU] -&gt; [긴급 탈출] 버튼 기능을 사용해 주시기를 부탁드립니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f7edcbf0-8a97-4e6e-bba7-8c1930a7a9e0\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-ef6c2586-aa3b-44ac-957a-51e93dc29b3e\">- OLD TALES 이벤트 필드에서 일부 한국어 음성에 특수 효과가 적용되지 않은 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f53d8f81-b236-42be-8f27-12fbb47b57aa\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-7afa195c-a040-479e-8583-5b79262134fc\">- 미니 게임 IN THE MIRROR에서 지역 이동 시, 체력 게이지 바가 일시적으로 어색하게 움직이는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e58ffcf6-a89d-47de-810c-a35a0a2f711a\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-b323ab45-a311-433a-8fc8-0718c09c84f4\">- 캠페인 필드에서 BGM 유실물 획득 시, UI가 어색하게 보이는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e80a405a-072b-4657-ad0a-71936426c1ca\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-40d48908-d301-4141-b603-7870bdad4efb\">- 복귀 미션에서 설문 조사를 완료할 수 없는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-426a039e-77a2-48c1-8366-0137641f52bc\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-7b0d678c-3832-4c2b-9b10-7daeb9bc12b1\">└ 설문 조사를 다시 응답해 주시면 보상을 획득할 수 있습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-57907f3f-cdfa-4815-8298-8e142ea22bae\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-bee8a0fd-8e5e-4a5c-b483-2bd0fe3b62d2\">- 일부 언어의 로컬라이징 이슈를 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4b86c2a4-9dff-4777-a6c3-d93ccb3d9ee7\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-77aa590c-b6aa-4622-8124-46add255d076\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-e40b51fe-ad11-4349-acf1-8ff42e445f82\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-b9333f64-6c4b-467d-a2b8-9e3099a0a52d\">​※ 재접속 후 업데이트 리소스 다운로드를 부탁드립니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-0c86b72e-7729-4afe-9425-c6ddde3da3e9\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-33dc5dbc-8eb9-4e51-b158-de4bc0fa7ace\">※ 인앱 구매(확률형 아이템 포함)</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9b39fffe-b830-49f8-8ce4-017be2dba078\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-76115934-2d73-4b5c-85f7-ebdfb634c356\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9bfd9872-8faa-4772-93d5-a4b7983dc4dd\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-11b24cac-4605-4c64-b9b5-4c37d88342d9\">·····················································································​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2f3fc6ce-ca54-4800-b3f0-f6f527ca2586\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-6420763e-c6c5-4ebf-a5bd-638c9314a661\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8061266a-3b2c-4779-814d-a184d3cdd51c\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothi